---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import SubscribeForm from '../../components/SubscribeForm.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Free Prenup Conversation Scripts — The Money Talk Script Kit | PrenupAnswers"
  description="Four copy-paste scripts for bringing up a prenup without sounding like you're planning to divorce, plus timing rules and recovery lines. Free printable PDF."
  noindex={true}
>
  <section class="article-head">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="crumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> / <a href="/free/">Free Downloads</a> / Scripts</p>
      <h1>The Money Talk Script Kit</h1>
      <p class="meta">Printable PDF · 2 pages · free forever</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container read">
      <div class="tldr">
        <b>What you get</b>
        <p>
          The conversation you've been dreading takes twelve seconds. This kit gives you the four sentences
          that survive them — a universal opener, one for when you earn more, one for debt or a business,
          and the answer to <em>"Do you think we'll fail?"</em>
        </p>
      </div>

      <ul>
        <li><strong>The frame:</strong> "I want to do this right" instead of "in case we divorce."</li>
        <li><strong>Timing rules:</strong> 3–6 months out, never during a fight, never the final week.</li>
        <li><strong>Four scripts</strong> you can read straight off the page, with the note on why each line works.</li>
        <li><strong>If it goes badly:</strong> the exact recovery lines for hurt, silence, and refusal.</li>
      </ul>

      <div class="isca-cta">
        <p class="eyebrow">Free download</p>
        <h4>Enter your email — the PDF lands on the next screen</h4>
        <p>Also get The Prenup Brief, our one-a-week email. Unsubscribe anytime.</p>
        <SubscribeForm variant="block" cta="Send me the scripts" source="lead-scripts" />
      </div>

      <p>
        <strong>Want the full playbook?</strong> The guide this kit is drawn from — timing, reactions, and
        the "cheat code" — is <a href="/guides/how-to-bring-up-a-prenup/">How to Bring Up a Prenup</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
